WEBVTT

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:32.541
So within that context, there's two theories of the case

00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:34.230
as to why we're all here.

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:35.819
The first theory of the case

00:02:35.819 --> 00:02:39.228
is that's all she wrote.

00:02:39.228 --> 00:02:40.587
Under that theory,

00:02:40.587 --> 00:02:42.423
we are the be-all and end-all

00:02:42.423 --> 00:02:44.156
of all creation.

00:02:44.156 --> 00:02:47.040
And the reason for trillions of galaxies,

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.053
sextillions of planets,

00:02:49.053 --> 00:02:53.763
is to create something that looks like that

00:02:53.763 --> 00:02:57.396
and something that looks like that.

00:02:57.396 --> 00:02:58.937
And that's the purpose of the universe;

00:02:58.937 --> 00:03:00.221
and then it flat-lines,